---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About">
  <div class="gut"><div class="in page prose">
    <div class="label">about</div>
    <h1>A layman working it out</h1>
    <p>Monday Morning Catholic is a personal project by a lay Catholic and software engineer. It explores the faith in three movements: why believe in a skeptical world, how to explain it, and how to live it out Monday to Friday.</p>
    <p>This is a personal, lay perspective. It is not an official Church site and does not speak for the Church. Where it teaches, it tries to follow the Catechism of the Catholic Church and the Doctors of the Church.</p>
    <p>Your prayer list, saved prayers, and saved passages are stored only in your own browser. Nothing is sent to a server.</p>
  </div></div>
</Base>

<style>
  .page { display: grid; gap: 14px; padding-block: 36px 56px; }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(34px, 5.4vw, 52px); }
  p { margin: 0; font-size: 18px; }
</style>
